  "label": "Incongruity humor",
  "description": "The humor derives from the juxtaposition of a cute, innocent image (a baby in a bear costume) with a crude, taboo concept ('shit on it'). This relies on background knowledge of comedic techniques, specifically incongruity humor, where the clash between two unrelated or opposing elements (cute vs. vulgar) creates surprise and amusement.",
